# PRD — Employee Experience Analytics

## Overview

**Product:** QuestionPro Employee Experience (EX) — Analytics Module
**What it does:** Provides HR admins and managers a high-level view of active initiatives, tasks, ideas, contributor performance, and goal progress across the organisation's employee experience programs.
**Primary users:** HR Administrators, People Managers, Organisation Admins
**Design system:** WickUI component library — all components, typography, spacing, color tokens, and card styles must strictly follow WickUI conventions. No custom one-off components or gray container boxes outside the design system.

## Key Entities

- **Initiatives** — Structured programs or projects (e.g. Wellbeing Program, Continuous Listening)
- **Tasks** — Action items within initiatives, assigned to contributors
- **Ideas** — New suggestions submitted by employees or managers
- **Goals** — Organisational or team-level objectives tracked within EX
- **Contributors** — Employees or managers who complete the most tasks (leaderboard)
- **Snapshot** — Aggregated count metrics for the current period

## Primary User Actions

- View snapshot metrics (active initiatives, tasks in progress, new ideas)
- Filter analytics by time period (Last 12 months, Last 6 months, Last 30 days, Custom)
- Export analytics data as CSV or PDF
- Switch between Tasks and Initiatives views in Status Summary
- Filter Status Summary by goal and status
- View top contributors leaderboard
- View goal distribution by percent or count

