## Screens & Flows

### Analytics Dashboard

**URL:** /analytics
**Purpose:** Give HR admins a single-screen overview of the health and activity of all employee experience programs — initiatives, tasks, ideas, goal progress, and contributor performance.
**Data shown:**
- Snapshot metrics: count of Active Initiatives, Tasks in Progress, New Ideas — for the selected time period
- Top Contributors: ranked list of employees/managers who closed the most tasks this week; empty state when no data
- Top Goals: donut chart of goal distribution with legend, filterable by Status (All status, Active, Completed); toggle between Percent and Count views
- Status Summary: tabbed view (Tasks | Initiatives) with Goals filter and status filter; shows list/table of goals with Active and Completed indicators; empty state when no data

**Actions:**
- **Time period dropdown** (top right) — filters all widgets on the page to the selected period; options: Last 12 months, Last 6 months, Last 30 days, Custom range
- **Export button** (download icon, top right) — exports current analytics view as CSV or PDF
- **Tasks / Initiatives toggle** (Status Summary) — switches the Status Summary table between tasks data and initiatives data
- **Goals filter** (Status Summary) — dropdown to filter by a specific goal
- **All status filter** (Status Summary) — dropdown to filter by Active or Completed
- **Percent / Count toggle** (Top Goals) — switches the donut chart legend values between percentage and raw count
- **Status filter** (Top Goals) — filters goal segments shown in the donut chart

