## Terminology

| Term | Definition |
|------|------------|
| Initiative | A structured employee experience program or project (e.g. Wellbeing, Continuous Listening) |
| Task | An action item within an initiative, assigned to a contributor |
| Idea | A suggestion submitted by an employee or manager within the EX platform |
| Goal | An organisational or team-level objective tracked within EX programs |
| Contributor | An employee or manager ranked by number of tasks completed |
| Snapshot | Summary count of key metrics for the selected time period |
| Status Summary | A tabbed table view showing the status of goals broken down by tasks or initiatives |
| WickUI | QuestionPro's internal design system — the single source of truth for all UI components, tokens, and patterns |